    "title": "Analyst: CCP Wants Ukraine War Dragged Out for Global Power Play",
    "text": "Russia has signaled interest in a trilateral meeting with India and China, as questions mount over how the Russia-Ukraine war will end. National security expert and China analyst Casey Fleming joined NTD’s Tiffany Meier to discuss the Chinese Communist Party’s (CCP) role in the conflict and how it is using the war to weaken the United States while advancing its global ambitions.\nAnalyst: CCP Wants Ukraine War Dragged Out for Global Power Play\nRussia has signaled interest in a trilateral meeting with India and China, as questions mount over how the Russia-Ukraine war will end.\nBy\n|\nPublished: 8/20/2025, 11:59:40 PM EDT",
